{"kind": "mod", "id": 1593, "name": "LiveBitcoinPricesREDUX", "slug": "livebitcoinpricesredux", "teaser": "Adjust SPT Bitcoin prices to match Live!", "owner_name": "Shardbyte", "downloads": 4892, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:04:11.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-26T18:08:49.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-26T18:08:49.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p><strong>LiveBitcoinPricesREDUX</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/zDpMz4Q7/tarkov-bitcoin.webp\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/zDpMz4Q7/tarkov-bitcoin.webp\" alt=\"tarkov-bitcoin.webp\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dynamically update the price of bitcoin to match it’s current value in live.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>This mod has been updated to support SPT versions <strong>3.9.0-3.9.x</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A few small language fixes have been applied.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is a pretty straight-forward mod to dynamically update the price of bitcoin to match the current price in live.</p>\n<p>Data for the current bitcoin price is fetched from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://tarkov.dev\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tarkov Dev</a>.</p>\n<p>The original version of this mod can be found <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1767-live-bitcoin-prices\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4892, "published_at": "2024-07-26T18:08:49.000000Z", "forge_link": "https: